<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN OF 91-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 300 MLN OF 91-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 300 million zlotys worth of its 91-day bills, maturing August 6, 1997, at a tender for money market dealers with overnight settlement date, the bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
